## Tech Stack

| Technology | Version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Supabase | Latest | Database-as-a-Service platform |
| PostgreSQL | 15+ (Supabase managed) | Relational database engine |
| Supabase Auth | Built-in | Admin user authentication |
| Row Level Security (RLS) | Built-in | Data access control |
| Supabase Realtime | Built-in (optional) | Live updates for admin (future) |

---

## Why Selected

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| Supabase over Firebase | PostgreSQL (relational) better for structured donation data + SQL queries |
| Supabase over raw PostgreSQL | Managed service, built-in auth, RLS, dashboard, free tier |
| Supabase over MongoDB | Donation data is structured + relational (cause → donations), SQL better fit |
| PostgreSQL over MySQL | UUID support, JSON columns, better RLS, Supabase default |
| Managed over Self-hosted | No DevOps overhead, automatic backups, free tier sufficient for MVP |

