## Data Model Reference

> Full schema defined in [ERD.mdc](../extended/ERD.mdc)

### Quick Reference
```
causes          → id, title, description, target_amount, raised_amount, is_active
donations       → id, cause_id(FK), donor_name, donor_email, amount, status, razorpay_*
admin_users     → id, email, name, role, supabase_auth_id(FK)
```

### Status Values
```
initiated → pending → completed (happy path)
initiated → cancelled (user cancelled)
pending → failed (payment failed)
completed → refunded (manual refund)
```

---

## Backup & Recovery

### Supabase Managed (Free Tier)
- Daily automatic backups (retained 7 days)
- Point-in-time recovery not available on free tier
- Manual backup: Export via Supabase Dashboard → SQL Editor

### Recommended Practice
- Export migration SQL to version control
- Seed data committed to repository
- RLS policies committed as SQL files
- Before production: Consider Supabase Pro for PITR
